  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845867,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - From Russia with Love (GameCube)\n\nStep back into the iconic world of James Bond with *007 - From Russia with Love* for the GameCube, a thrilling adaptation of the classic 1963 film.  Experience the suave espionage and intense action as Agent 007 navigates a treacherous plot involving the theft of a vital Soviet encoding machine, the Lektor.  Due to legal complications, the nefarious organization SPECTRE is rebranded as OCTOPUS, lacking a clear leader and adding a layer of mystery to the unfolding events.\n\nThe game features Sean Connery's likeness and voice acting, marking his return to the role and a video game debut.  Relive key moments from the film while enjoying new action sequences and gadgets, including the iconic Aston Martin DB5 and the jetpack from *Thunderball*.  Developed by Electronic Arts, the gameplay mirrors the feel of earlier Bond games, offering a third-person perspective and a focus on combat and puzzle-solving.  Prepare for a respectful tribute to Bond's formative years, complete with a 1960s aesthetic and a soundtrack recorded at Abbey Road Studios."
    },
